      "title": "Identifying Yutek-NN Personnel Linked to Past Cyber Campaigns Serving Russian State Interests",
      "summary": "Void Blizzard, also tracked as Laundry Bear, is linked to Yutek-NN, a private Russian company that the United States has indicted for cyber espionage on behalf of the Russian government. The report identifies Anton Listarov as the person who controlled accounts and infrastructure used in 2021 email campaigns targeting Russian opposition activists supporting Alexei Navalny. Those campaigns used a leaked database of Free Navalny registrants to send threats and fake Smart Voting recommendations before the 2021 Duma election. The investigators assess with moderate confidence that Vyacheslav Zubkov coordinated with Listarov, and both reportedly worked under Denis Obrezko. The report links the activity to FSB and Presidential Administration interests, though it does not establish direct state tasking.",
